sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant DSXL as DS-XL Coder
    participant User as User
    participant Guard as Guardian
    participant Target as Target Device

    Dev->>DSXL: Connect USB-C cable
    DSXL->>Target: Detect attached device
    DSXL->>User: Show package summary
    User->>DSXL: Consent confirm
    alt guardian_restrictions
        DSXL->>Guard: Approval request
        Guard->>DSXL: Approve / Deny
    end
    Target->>User: Trust prompt on target screen
    User->>Target: Accept
    DSXL->>DSXL: deploy_package(usb_c)
    DSXL->>Target: Transfer bundle (future MTP)
    Note over DSXL,Target: signed_bundle_placeholder verify
    Target->>Target: Install package
    Target->>User: Success + rollback option
